						"category":"concrete",
						"created":"2025-01-09T07:44:02.502110+01:00",
						"description":"This realistic 3D texture features a white-painted surface applied over a concrete wall. The texture captures the natural imperfections of the concrete, with subtle bumps and slight unevenness, giving the wall a genuine, lived-in look. The matte finish and gentle surface irregularities add depth and character, avoiding the sterile appearance of perfectly smooth walls. Ideal for indoor environments, this texture creates an authentic feel, perfect for spaces that require a more natural, non-polished aesthetic while still maintaining the clean look of white paint over concrete.",
