						"created":"2025-04-10T08:50:30.827676+02:00",
						"description":"The Street Sign Pole Direction 3D model showcases a realistic and detailed representation of an urban directional signpost. Featuring a sturdy vertical pole with multiple arrow-shaped signboards pointing in various directions, this model captures the classic look of wayfinding signage seen on city streets or tourist spots. Each signboard can be customized with text or symbols to indicate locations, distances, or landmarks. The materials and textures are carefully crafted to reflect weathered metal, painted surfaces, and subtle wear for added realism. Ideal for use in city scenes, navigation apps, or architectural visualizations, this model combines functionality with a clean and professional aesthetic.",
